WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Sultanpur, around 1499.

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:07.660
A young storekeeper named Nanak
goes to bathe in the Bein river.

3
00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.500
He does not come back.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.350
For three days, there is no sign of him.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.180
Sikh stories say he was
taken to God's court,

6
00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.440
then sent back with a task.

7
00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.020
So what did he come back
saying, and why does it matter?

8
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:24.320
In this mission, you'll find
out how we know about his life,

9
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.770
from his own hymns to stories
written down much later.

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.070
Then you'll follow his journeys
with the musician Mardana,

11
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.730
and meet a killer who heard
a song about shiny bronze.

12
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.350
Your mission: find out what
Guru Nanak came back saying,

13
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.630
and why it matters.
